title = "Paths"
subtitle = "Guides that curve, loop and live in 4D."
body = "1  Arrows follow any curve, turning as they go.   2  Blocks round a spiral, each turning with it.   3  Arrows arriving at a pad: stand here.   4  This path bends out through W and is gone, then comes back.   5  A loop drifting through W: only what is at your W is there. Turn the slice.   6  A line with pulses crossing itself.   7  Two speeds, two ways."
code = "blue"

